From d7ea083d14bc74aa93fbd0d4d0c51c42e3851a25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wu <wuc8974@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 15:37:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(feishu-deploy): hoist Feishu deps + 3 missing plugin-sdk
 exports

Required to load the Feishu channel at runtime. Same class of issue as M12 v2.

Hoisted 5 deps to root so they get resolved from root node_modules at runtime (the Feishu extension declares them in extensions/feishu/package.json but pnpm does not hoist workspace deps):

  @larksuiteoapi/node-sdk@1.71.1  (Feishu official SDK)

  mdast-util-from-markdown@^2.0.0  (markdown rendering)

  mdast-util-gfm-table@2.0.0

  micromark-extension-gfm-table@2.1.1

  typebox@1.3.6

Added 3 missing plugin-sdk subpath exports (same class of issue as M12 cli-argv):

  ./plugin-sdk/channel-dm-policy

  ./plugin-sdk/media-local-roots

  ./plugin-sdk/session-catalog-runtime

After this commit, the Feishu channel loads at gateway startup. With real FEISHU_APP_ID/FEISHU_APP_SECRET env vars, the websocket connection to Feishu is attempted.
